# `src` folder structure

```
src/
  app.tsx
  main.tsx
  config.ts
  styles.css
  vite-env.d.ts
  components/
  layouts/        # e.g. home.layout.tsx
  pages/          # e.g. pages/home/sample-page/
  providers/
  resources/
  tools/
```

- Use lowercase kebab-case filenames.
- Prefer `*.layout.tsx`, `*.provider.tsx`, `*.tool.ts` suffixes.
- UI library: **antd** (not MUI).
